    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Turn-Based Roguelike Game]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the wizard Isha, embark on an adventure to decipher the magic book and resolve the anomalies occurring in this land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Conquer Dungeons with Various Builds]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the roguelike element of obtaining items each time you defeat enemies, you can also customize the items you take with you when challenging dungeons to suit your preferences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in deciphering the magic book, you'll be able to freely create spells by combining the decoded words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think up the ultimate build and conquer the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Unique and Diverse Characters]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playable characters include the protagonist, Isha; Isha's sister, Lipka; and their childhood friend, the elf Zeeka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has different items and stats that they bring into dungeons. If you're stuck on a challenge, trying a different character might just do the trick!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Turn-Based Roguelike Game]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the wizard Isha, embark on an adventure to decipher the magic book and resolve the anomalies occurring in this land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Conquer Dungeons with Various Builds]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the roguelike element of obtaining items each time you defeat enemies, you can also customize the items you take with you when challenging dungeons to suit your preferences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in deciphering the magic book, you'll be able to freely create spells by combining the decoded words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think up the ultimate build and conquer the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Unique and Diverse Characters]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playable characters include the protagonist, Isha; Isha's sister, Lipka; and their childhood friend, the elf Zeeka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has different items and stats that they bring into dungeons. If you're stuck on a challenge, trying a different character might just do the trick!</p>",
